'''Last Updated September 19, 2026'''

'''''This item is NOT considered a [[Clothing Betas|Clothing Beta]] by most Jammers.'''''

The '''Beard''' was released during the Beta Testing, and was formerly sold at Jam Mart Clothing. It was removed from stores shortly after its initial release. It can be won in the Forgotten Desert, with the exception of the Leap Year, RIM, and Luminous variants.

